{
  "productSlug": "salesforce-commerce-cloud",
  "shortDescription": "Salesforce Commerce Cloud (B2C Commerce, formerly Demandware) is Salesforce’s enterprise hosted commerce suite for complex B2C/B2B storefronts, catalogs, and Marketing Cloud adjacency. Pricing is quote-only as a GMV percentage across Growth, Plus, and Premium — Salesforce does not publish a monthly list tile. Magento/Adobe Commerce is the open-source enterprise peer; SFCC is the Salesforce SaaS enterprise path. Research grounded 2026-08-18 from Salesforce commerce pricing pages. Landscape peer — does not displace Shopify as the SMB/mid-market SaaS award.",
